      "transcript": {
        "text": "Under the hood, wallet wall treats every wallet address as a question, and Wallet Wallaby walks the answer. Each stablecoin balance is read on-chain, then recorded with its provenance, which block, which source, and which rule produced it. The scoring runs in BigQuery and it is deterministic. The same inputs always produce the same migration readiness tier. That matters when a tier is challenged because the evidence can be replayed instead of argued about. If a wallet address looks ready, the readiness is a claim with a trail behind it, not a feeling.",
